{title: Hallelujah (Your Love is Amazing)}
{artist: Brenton Brown & Brian Doerkson}
{key: G}

{comment: Verse 1}
Your love is [G/B]amazing, steady and [C2]unchanging,
Your love is a [Dsus]mountain, firm beneath my [C2]feet
Your love is a [G/B]mystery, how you gently [C2]lift me,
When I am [Dsus]surrounded, your love carries [C2]me

{comment: Chorus}
[G]Hallelujah, [Dsus]Hallelujah, [Em7]Hallelujah, [C]your love makes me sing (x2)

{comment: Verse 2}
Your love is [G/B]surprising, I can feel it [C2]rising,
All the joy thats [Dsus]growing deep inside of [C2]me
Every time I [G/B]see you, all your goodness [C2]shines through,
And I can feel this [Dsus]God song, rising up in [C2]me
